# docs/requests.http — VS Code REST Client
# Fase 3.9 — Ejemplos para probar local (requiere docker compose up)

### Health NGINX
GET http://localhost:80/health

### Health productos (DB)
GET http://localhost:80/api/v1/productos/health

### Health liveness
GET http://localhost:80/api/v1/productos/health/live

### List productos paginado
GET http://localhost:80/api/v1/productos?page=1&limit=5&sort=created_at_desc

### Create producto (falsy fix: precio 0, stock 0)
POST http://localhost:80/api/v1/productos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Tornillo M8",
  "precio": 0,
  "stock": 0
}

### Create producto valid
POST http://localhost:80/api/v1/productos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "CI Test Widget",
  "precio": 4.99,
  "stock": 10
}

### Validation error (nombre vacío, precio negativo)
POST http://localhost:80/api/v1/productos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "",
  "precio": -5
}

### List ordenes
GET http://localhost:80/api/v1/ordenes?page=1&limit=10

### Create orden (FK check)
POST http://localhost:80/api/v1/ordenes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "producto_id": 1,
  "cantidad": 2,
  "total": 50.00
}

### Create orden FK 404
POST http://localhost:80/api/v1/ordenes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "producto_id": 9999,
  "cantidad": 1,
  "total": 10
}

### List stock
GET http://localhost:80/api/v1/stock?limit=3

### Create stock movimiento
POST http://localhost:80/api/v1/stock
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "producto_id": 1,
  "cantidad": 5,
  "tipo": "entrada"
}

### Compat legacy (sin /v1)
GET http://localhost:80/api/productos
GET http://localhost:80/api/ordenes
GET http://localhost:80/api/stock
